              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "合并来源与证据，不增加缺陷计数"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "tr",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "一方主张复用，另一方以规则变化证明少退"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "设计偏好与业务失败冲突"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "保留理由，失败不能被维护偏好抵消"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "tr",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "一条所有权缺失，一条快照绕过"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "独立根因"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "分别保留，分别验证"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "tr",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "两角色都称少退，却引用修复日志"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "共同证据错误"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "td",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "先退回证据门禁，不计为共识"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "当前去重函数处理第一类，不理解第二类的自然语言争论。它选择主体意见并合并引用，不能保证保存全部相反理由。需要完整争议记录时，调用方应保留原始角色输出，再交人工复核；本章没有实现模型裁判或辩论协议。"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "h2",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "9.8.3 当前规则怎样决定报告动作"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "规则函数的核心优先级可简化为："
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "code_block",
    "language": "python",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "if high_risk or any(f.needs_human for f in findings):\n    return \"escalate\"\nif any(f.blocking for f in findings):\n    return \"request_changes\"\nif findings:\n    return \"comment\"\nreturn \"approve\""
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "高风险优先进入人工，意味着 ORD-09 即使有阻断意见，报告动作也为 escalate，而不是 request_changes。报告仍保留 blocking=true 的 Finding，不能把升级误解成缺陷被忽略。"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
